A collection of Multisim experiment reports prepared during my electronics learning journey. 
This repository contains DOCX-based lab reports covering circuit simulation, waveform analysis, component testing, and verification of 
important electronics concepts using NI Multisim.
## About this repository
This repository is meant to document practical experiments done in Multisim in a clear and organized report format. 
Each report explains the objective, circuit setup, simulation process, results, and conclusion of the experiment.

## What it includes
Multisim experiment reports in DOCX format.

Circuit diagrams and simulation results.

Basic electronics and circuit analysis topics.

Lab-style explanations of each experiment.

Learning-based documentation for academic use.



